# Cursor Desktop OOM mitigation for this Helbreath / ChainLords monorepo.
# Official docs: https://cursor.com/docs/reference/ignore-file
# Cursor already honors .gitignore plus a default media/lockfile list.
# Current official docs do not use .cursorindexingignore -- this file is enough.
#
# Goal: skip huge git-tracked binaries Cursor does not edit, so Windows
# indexing / Agent discovery does not blow the Electron renderer (reason: oom).
#
# Do NOT ignore hand-edited source: *.cs *.ts *.tsx Server.cs rpg-ui.css
# or Config/*.json (Items, Monsters, GameWorlds, etc.).

# Duplicated client runtime assets (~278MB each): .spr sprites, .amd maps, images, audio
multiplayer/mp-client/public/assets/
sp-client/public/assets/

# Server map binaries (same .amd set as public/assets/maps, ~33MB)
multiplayer/server/Config/maps/

# Local build outputs (also in .gitignore; keep leftover Windows/Linux copies out of the indexer)
**/node_modules/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/.pnpm-store/
**/publish-*/
middleware/target/

# Tracked Playwright / critique screenshot dumps (~77MB of PNGs)
multiplayer/mp-client/scripts/*-out/

# Game binary extensions if they appear outside the trees above
*.spr
*.amd
*.pak
